{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14960","headline":"宴赵氏昆季书院因与会文幷率尔投赠 · 卢纶","name":"宴赵氏昆季书院因与会文幷率尔投赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗礼挹余波，相懽在琢磨。\n琴尊方会集，珠玉忽骈罗。\n谢族风流盛，于门福庆多。\n花攒骐骥枥，锦绚凤凰窠。\n咏雪因饶妹，书经爲爱鹅。\n仍闻广练被，更有远儒过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}